{78}{The Ring of Brodgar is the exact spot where Nasrudin banished the evil Arronax after their epic battle!  Apparently the banishment spell created a tremendous opening or "rift" between our world and that of the void.}{The Ring of Brodgar is the exact spot where Nasrudin banished the evil Arronax after their epic battle!  Apparently the banishment spell created a tremendous opening or "rift" between our world and that of the void.}{}{}{}{}
{79}{What did they do to close it?}{}{5}{}{82}{}
