{82}{The few great mages that survived the battle had to erect the Ring in order to seal the rift.  I have read that they placed magickal wards of tremendous power throughout the Ring to keep the seal in place.}{The few great mages that survived the battle had to erect the Ring in order to seal the rift.  I have read that they placed magickal wards of tremendous power throughout the Ring to keep the seal in place.}{}{}{}{lf4 1}
