{90}{I have studied many things.  I received technological training from the great university in Tarant.  I have also studied magick in the wondrous city of Tulla.  Through all of my learning, I have developed a theory...}{I have studied many things.  I received technological training from the great university in Tarant.  I have also studied magick in the wondrous city of Tulla.  Through all of my learning, I have developed a theory...}{}{}{}{}
