{95}{I believe that all things work in cycles.  Everything natural goes through cycles of ebb and flow.  I believe magick and technology are no different.  There is only one major flaw with my theory...}{I believe that all things work in cycles.  Everything natural goes through cycles of ebb and flow.  I believe magick and technology are no different.  There is only one major flaw with my theory...}{}{}{}{}
